+/**
+ * Termux/Android has no prebuilt package (and a glibc-built binary cannot load
+ * into bionic Node). Call libc's flock(2) through koffi instead. LOCK_EX|LOCK_NB
+ * never blocks, so the synchronous native call keeps the async API's semantics.
